User "1" -- "0..*" RefreshToken
User "1" -- "0..*" PhoneOtp : phone_e164
User "1" -- "0..*" EmailVerification
User "1" -- "0..*" PasswordReset
User "1" -- "0..*" PushToken
User "0..1" -- "0..1" MediaObject : avatar
User "1" -- "0..1" Wallet
User "1" -- "0..*" KycSubmission

KycSubmission "1" -- "1" MediaObject : id_front
KycSubmission "1" -- "1" MediaObject : id_back
KycSubmission "1" -- "1" MediaObject : selfie
KycSubmission "0..1" -- "0..1" KycSubmission : retry_of

User "1" -- "0..*" Trip : "as traveler"
Trip "0..*" -- "1" Airport : origin
Trip "0..*" -- "1" Airport : destination
Trip "1" -- "0..*" TripStopover
TripStopover "0..*" -- "1" Airport
Trip "0..1" -- "0..1" MediaObject : ticket
Trip "1" -- "0..*" FlightTrackingSnapshot

User "1" -- "0..*" ParcelRequest : "as sender"
ParcelRequest <|-- DeliveryRequest
ParcelRequest <|-- ProductRequest
ParcelRequest "1" -- "0..*" ParcelMedia
ParcelMedia "0..*" -- "1" MediaObject

ParcelRequest "1" -- "0..*" Match
Trip "1" -- "0..*" Match
Match "1" -- "1..*" Offer
Offer "0..1" -- "0..*" Offer : parent_offer
Match "1" -- "0..*" MatchEvent

Match "1" -- "0..*" PaymentIntent
PaymentIntent "1" -- "0..*" PaymentEvent
PaymentIntent "1" -- "0..*" Refund

Wallet "1" -- "0..*" WalletEntry
Wallet "1" -- "0..*" Withdrawal
WalletEntry "0..*" -- "0..1" PaymentIntent
WalletEntry "0..*" -- "0..1" Match

Match "1" -- "0..2" HandoverCode

Match "1" -- "0..1" Conversation
Conversation "1" -- "1..*" ConversationMember
Conversation "1" -- "0..*" ChatMessage
ConversationMember "0..*" -- "1" User

User "1" -- "0..*" Notification
User "1" -- "0..1" NotificationPreference

Match "1" -- "0..*" Dispute
User "1" -- "0..*" AdminAuditLog : actor

' Cross-package
Notification "0..*" -- "0..1" Match
Notification "0..*" -- "0..1" ParcelRequest
Notification "0..*" -- "0..1" Trip

' =========================================================
' INVARIANTS / BUSINESS RULES (notes)
' =========================================================
note top of Trip
  Invariants
  - traveler.kyc.status = APPROVED  before status can move past PENDING_APPROVAL
  - sum(active Match.weight_kg) <= capacity_kg  (reserved_kg cache)
  - origin and destination must differ
  - one of {origin.country, destination.country} must be DZ
end note

note bottom of Offer
  Pricing rules (frozen on creation)
  - DELIVERY: commission = round(price * 0.25); base_fee = 0
  - PRODUCT : commission tiered on price; base_fee = 2500
      <30k:0%  | 30k–54.99k:7% | 55k–99.99k:5% | >=100k:3%
  - total = price + commission + base_fee  (must hold)
  - Counter chain: parent_offer_id walks back to original
end note

note right of HandoverCode
  - 4-digit numeric, hashed with bcrypt/argon2
  - PICKUP issued by SENDER → spoken to TRAVELER at pickup point
  - DELIVERY issued by SENDER → given to receiver → typed by TRAVELER
  - max 5 attempts; lockout requires admin reset
  - PICKUP consumed → ParcelRequest.status = IN_TRANSIT
  - DELIVERY consumed → status = DELIVERED, escrow released
end note

note left of PaymentIntent
  Idempotency
  - idempotency_key required for create  (Stripe-style)
  - provider_event_id is unique on PaymentEvent (webhook replay safe)
  - amounts in DZD as integer  (no fractional currency)
  - on success: WalletEntry HOLD on traveler wallet
  - on DELIVERY confirmed: WalletEntry RELEASE → balance += amount
  - dispute can move money back via Refund
end note

note bottom of ParcelRequest
  Status machine
  DRAFT → OPEN → OFFER_PENDING → MATCHED → PAID
        → PICKED_UP → IN_TRANSIT → DELIVERED
  Branches: CANCELLED (any pre-PAID), REFUNDED (post-PAID), DISPUTED.
  PRODUCT vs DELIVERY share the table (single-table inheritance with type column).
end note

note top of MediaObject
  - object_key = "<bucket>/<yyyy>/<mm>/<uuid>.<ext>"
  - Flutter NEVER receives Supabase service-role keys
  - All reads go via signed URL endpoint (5-min TTL)
  - KYC bucket is admin-readable only
end note

